WEBVTT

00:01:59.411 --> 00:02:01.047
I fired the shots

00:02:01.047 --> 00:02:04.900
that caused a man's death.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:06.810
When I entered prison,

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:12.317
I was bitter, I was angry, I was hurt.

00:02:12.317 --> 00:02:15.287
I didn't want to take responsibility.

00:02:15.287 --> 00:02:17.339
I blamed everybody from my parents

00:02:17.339 --> 00:02:20.312
to the system.

00:02:20.312 --> 00:02:22.524
I rationalized my decision to shoot

00:02:22.524 --> 00:02:24.963
because in the hood where I come from,

00:02:24.963 --> 00:02:26.589
it's better to be the shooter

00:02:26.589 --> 00:02:29.901
than the person getting shot.

00:02:29.901 --> 00:02:33.223
As I sat in my cold cell,